この流れ（まだ流れてる？）で昨日業務で久しぶりに使ったコマンドシェアするのですが\n```git merge-file hoge.txt hoge.common.txt hoge.theirs.txt```\nで hoge.common.txt から hoge.theirs.txt への差分を hoge.txt に merge できます。\n\n例えば改行コード変えられちゃってるコミットなんかでパッチ化（cherry-pick とか）できないとき、一旦ファイルに書き出してゴニョれます。","ts":"1621907012.291800","thread_ts":"1621907012.291800","edited":{"user":"UPWFF5YQ7","ts":"1621907021.000000"},"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]},{"name":"tips","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tWaO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ff78cd4-6c10-43fd-9848-2b4a9e45cb99","type":"message","user":"UPWFF5YQ7","text":"\u0026gt; ours\n\u0026gt; merged\n\u0026gt; thiers\n3way merge だと common というのもあって（ややこしいことを言い出す）","ts":"1621903723.284900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/Ddj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f6f8e48-1a3c-4b79-b51f-5654341f13b1","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u0026gt; set diffopt=vertical\nありがとうございます！","ts":"1621903582.284000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W2kC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7b6732e-2668-4ee9-b584-30bc55a6082e","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"ginaそろそろ活用できるようになりたい…","ts":"1621903561.283800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aCku="}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a1df87e-4467-4943-b8f2-1574ce6d5ac3","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"ですね","ts":"1621903541.283200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u6j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7e9d038-c847-4903-8b83-6aeaeac37e26","type":"message","user":"U776661HA","text":"`set diffopt=vertical`","ts":"1621903538.283000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original"